*stress_cs_steel_max =  
* DESCRIPTION:   Allowable hoop stress in Central Solenoid structural material (Pa) (icc=72)
* JUSTIFICATION: Not used. Using default

*str_cs_con_res = 
* DESCRIPTION:   Residual manufacturing strain in CS superconductor material
* JUSTIFICATION: Not set, assuming default

*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

*icc = 90
* DESCRIPTION:   Constraint equation for minimum CS coil stress load cycles
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, not concerned with CS stress cycles
