* JUSTIFICATION: Not set. Not using i_blanket_type = 2

*fblhebmo = 
* DESCRIPTION:   Helium fraction of outboard blanket box manifold by volume (`i_blanket_type=2` (KIT HCPB))
* JUSTIFICATION: Not set. Not using i_blanket_type = 2

*fblhebpi = 
